{"seq":1,"slug":"conduct-controversies","title":"言行争议","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/elon-musk/controversies-and-appraisal/conduct-controversies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"management-and-labor","title":"管理与劳工争议","url":"/c/people/elon-musk/controversies-and-appraisal/conduct-controversies/management-and-labor","wordCount":1627,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"public-statements-and-social-media","title":"公开言论与社交媒体","url":"/c/people/elon-musk/controversies-and-appraisal/conduct-controversies/public-statements-and-social-media","wordCount":1548,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 言行争议\n\n马斯克的争议，首先集中在他的管理风格与公开言行上。本章直面这两个备受讨论的话题。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"管理与劳工争议\"——他严苛高压的管理、对工会的强硬态度引发的批评。第二篇文档讲述\"公开言论与社交媒体\",剖析他口无遮拦的风格如何屡屡引发失言、风波与法律麻烦。\n"}